Multi represents multiple inputs
modal-> a type or form of information
COT->a reasoning approach that breaks a problem into intermediate steps
Multimodal CoT is a prompting technique in which an AI uses information from multiple types of input, such as text and images, to reason through a problem and produce an answer.
